before you get stoned.  The fight usually progresses like this...

The cockatrice hits. -more- 
You hear the cockatrice's hissing.  ...
The cockatrice hits. -more- 
Your limbs feel heavy.	<-Now's the time to eat, 'cause you'll die on
The cockatrice hits. -more-				the next turn.
You turn to stone. -more-	<-What'd I tell you?

